{ 219. Vassily Ivanchuk – Magnus Carlsen, Monte Carlo  (blindfold)  2011 }
1. Ndb5 { ✔ Winning a pawn, with the bishop pair and d6-square, gives a decisive advantage.  Somewhat weaker is winning the b6-pawn with:   1.Ncb5  Qb8  2.Nxd6  Qxd6  3.Nxc6  Qxc6  4.Qd4+– } *


